=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to the {n:Nomad Moogle} next to {p:Maat} to begin the quest.
* Retrieve a {i:Seasoning Stone|Seasoning Stone|3541}, which drops off nearly all level 90+ regular monsters outside of Abyssea and trade it to the {n:Nomad Moogle}.
** The {i:Seasoning Stone|Seasoning Stone|3541} is also available from the {p:Login Campaign} for only 5 points.
* You will receive {k:Soul gem clasp} and access to the level 95 cap fight, {q:Beyond Infinity|Beyond Infinity|Beyond Infinity}.
** If you are defeated, speak to the Nomad Moogle to get another clasp for 1 merit point or 5x High Kindred Seals.
** When {n:Atori-Tutori} asks if you are ready, say 'Yes'. This does **not** start the BCNM fight, it merely advances the quest line.
* This quest is now technically completed. Continue to the next quest and win the BCNM {q:Beyond Infinity|Beyond Infinity|Beyond Infinity}.

=2 Lore
\**Minor spoilers for this quest and "{q:Beat Around the Bushin|Beat Around the Bushin|Beat Around the Bushin}" ({i:Black Belt|Black Belt|13186} quest)**
* Character highlights: {n:Atori-Tutori}
** The man who trained {p:Maat} and {p:Degenhard}.
** Said to be the strongest fighter in the Tenshodo.
** Was introduced in the level 75 MNK {m:Three Kings|HNM}-hunting quest {q:Beat Around the Bushin|Beat Around the Bushin|Beat Around the Bushin}, which Degenhard also appears in.

